        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Fjordcarver's jealousy for his rival is unquenchable, and he refuses to be shown up. Regardless of his initiative roll, Fjordcarver always takes his turn directly after Ashgut. If another creature delays their turn to go in between Ashgut and Fjordcarver, Fjordcarver takes his turn first and that creature's initiative is delayed until after Fjordcarver. If a player's initiative would change to force them between Fjordcarver and Ashgut (such as from being knocked unconscious) the player should move above Ashgut instead. </p>"
        },
