        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Fjordcarver's cold, condescending eyes chill a foe's bones. The target takes <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\">@Damage[3d8[cold]] damage with a (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:32|basic:false] save). Regardless of their save, the target is immune to Frosty Gaze for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and has their Speeds halved for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage, has their Speeds halved for 1 round, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, has their Speeds halved for 1 round, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</span></p>"
        },
